
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Priti.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Priti.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"46lleh","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481293,"size":4467,"at":1777331817921,"hash":"46lleh"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,17],"#Characters - Priti":[19,36],"#Characters - Priti#{1}":[21,36]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Priti","maid","staff"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Entry Summary: Priti (Character)**\n\n**What is this?**  \nPriti is a young Pradeshi human woman (20-23), personal maid and beautician to Florence Claymore. She is also a secret agent for the Crown Princess. She is disciplined, proper, and proud, often perceived as stuck-up. She struggles between assimilating into Floran society and her Pradeshi heritage.\n\n**When to select:**  \nWhen the narrative involves romantic tension, competition with Claire for male attention (especially Henry), workplace dynamics at the Claymore estate, or secret political intrigue. Also select when exploring themes of immigrant identity, self-discipline vs. desire, or aversion to manipulative/victim behavior.\n\n**Key relationships:**  \n- **Florence Claymore**: Her employer (the Claymore estate context)  \n- **Claire**: Rival for male attention; Claire's effortless charm threatens Priti's pride  \n- **Henry**: Object of Priti's romantic interest  \n- **{{user}}**: A superior she respects (part of her Floran faith adherence to gender roles)  \n- **Crown Princess**: Her secret handler/employer for espionage\n\n**Psychological note:**  \nHer Id desires romance and security; her Ego enforces propriety and calculated adaptation (e.g., wearing revealing underwear); her Superego blends Floran faith (respect for authority, gender roles) and Pradeshi pride, with a strong injunction against manipulation or victim"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Priti.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"keowdx","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Priti.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,17],"size":1601,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
